{
  "info": {
    "name": "ARMoS Tools 2.0 API",
    "description": "# ARMoS Tools 2.0 — API Collection (PRD)\n\nDokumentasi endpoint sesuai **PRD_ARMOS_TOOLS_2.0.md**.\n\n## Kontrak response\n```json\n{ \"status\": 200, \"message\": \"...\", \"data\": [], \"stub\": true }\n```\nError: `status` 400/500 + `message`.\n\n## Auth\nSemua `/api/*` wajib **session cookie** setelah login.\n1. Buka `GET /login` di browser (atau request ini) → hitung captcha\n2. `POST /login` dengan `nama`, `password`, `captcha`, `_token`\n3. Simpan cookie session untuk request API berikutnya\n4. Sertakan header `X-CSRF-TOKEN` untuk POST\n\n## Seed login lokal\n- nama: `admin`\n- password: `password`\n\n## Status implementasi\nEndpoint saat ini mengembalikan **stub JSON** (`stub: true`) — kontrak & validasi request sudah ada; koneksi TMS DB / external API menyusul per fase PRD.\n\n## Base URL default\n`http://amors-tools.nuradigital.test`\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://amors-tools.nuradigital.test"
    },
    {
      "key": "csrfToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "captchaAnswer",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "jobId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 — Auth (Session)",
      "description": "Login form berbasis session cookie (bukan JSON API utama). Captcha perkalian + auth tabel tools_user (field `nama`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Login Form (generate captcha)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Menampilkan form login + generate soal captcha `a × b` ke session."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "nama",
                  "value": "admin"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "password"
                },
                {
                  "key": "captcha",
                  "value": "{{captchaAnswer}}",
                  "description": "Isi hasil perkalian dari halaman login"
                },
                {
                  "key": "_token",
                  "value": "{{csrfToken}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Validasi captcha lalu Auth::attempt(['nama','password']) ke tabel tools_user. Sukses → redirect `/`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{csrfToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "_token",
                  "value": "{{csrfToken}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Logout, invalidate session, redirect /login."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
